              ['The first key point is the speed and convenient of a payment that needs nothing but a phone', 'After "the speed and", you need another noun, not an adjective.'],
              ['The first key point is the speed and convenience of a payment that needs anything but a phone', '"Anything but" means "not at all": it says the opposite of what you mean.']
